.* iSphere Update Library - Help                                         *
.*                                                                       *
.*-----------------------------------------------------------------------*
.* STRPREPRC Compile Options:                                            *
.*   >>PRE-COMPILER<<                                                    *
.*     >>CRTCMD<<    CRTPNLGRP  PNLGRP(&LI/&OB) +                        *
.*                              SRCFILE(&SL/&SF) SRCMBR(&SM);            *
.*       >>COMPILE<<                                                     *
.*       >>END-COMPILE<<                                                 *
