.*-----------------------------------------------------------------------*
:PNLGRP.
.*
:HELP name='UPDLIB/ALL'.
:IMHELP name=UPDLIB.
:IMHELP name='UPDLIB/LIB       '.
:EHELP.
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Command Help Text
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP NAME='UPDLIB'.
Update Library (UPDLIB) - Help
:P.
The UPDLIB command updates the iSphere library, after it has been
restored with another name than ISPHERE. It changes the commands
of the library, that refer to objects of library ISPHERE, to the
objects of the restored library. Command STRPREPRC is created
again from its source in file QSTRPREPRC.
:P.
The iSphere plug-in calls UPDLIB, when it transfers the iSphere
library with another name. Call UPDLIB yourself, when you restored
the library from the save file by hand, for example:
:XMP.
CHGCMD CMD(ISPHERE62/UPDLIB) PGM(*REXX) REXSRCFILE(ISPHERE62/QBUILD)
ISPHERE62/UPDLIB LIB(ISPHERE62)
:EXMP.
.*
:EHELP.
.*
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.* Help text of keyword LIB
.*--------------------------------------------------------------------
:HELP name='UPDLIB/LIB'.
Library - Help
:XH3.Library (LIB)
:P.
Specifies the name of the restored iSphere library.
:P.
This is a required parameter.
:EHELP.
.*
:EPNLGRP.
